    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinoslap is a chaotic, last-dino-standing multiplayer brawler where prehistoric creatures settle their differences with slaps and mayhem.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in vibrant arenas with a cast of colourful dinosaurs.  Dinoslap delivers fast, unpredictable fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against bots or with friends up to 6 players in frantic free-for-alls. Simple controls make it easy to pick up, but staying alive is another story. This is survival of the goofiest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for anyone who\u2019s ever wondered what a dino backhand feels like.</p>",
